{"title":"Chocolate Cow","slug":"Chocolate_Cow","hero":null,"pageid":3849,"revid":17401,"timestamp":"2025-03-08T11:46:58Z","lastEditor":"Insect607dart","categories":[],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.76.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"}],"body":"<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Chocolate Cow\">Chocolate Cow</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Chocolate Cow</b> is obtained by opening a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Box_Of_Chocolates/\">Box of Chocolates</a> from <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hearty_Exchange/\">Hearty Exchange</a>, available during Valentines day events. When a player opens a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Box_Of_Chocolates/\">Box of Chocolates</a>, there is a 12.3% chance that the item spawned is a <b>Chocolate Cow.</b>\n</p>"}
